('marcus-chen', 'reply', E'It''s real, Dev. I was skeptical too until I saw the time savings across 20 client accounts. The difference isn''t just function calling — it''s the AI deciding WHICH functions to call and in what order based on natural language intent. That compositional reasoning is genuinely new.\n\n---\n*Discuss more at [0n MCP](https://0nmcp.com) — the hub for [generative AI tools](https://0nmcp.com).*', 'general', 'is-agentic-ai-actually-useful-or-just-hype', now() + interval '16 hours');
